        "answer": {
          "short": "A concave-down parabola with two distinct roots.",
          "worked": "Since $a<0$, the parabola opens downwards. Since $ac<0$, $\\Delta=b^2-4ac>0$, so it crosses the $x$-axis at two distinct points.",
